  "body": "Tucked away in a peaceful and private position, just moments from the vibrant waterfront of Mission Bay, this beautifully appointed residence offers an impressive combination of quality, space and sophisticated coastal living. Spanning three generous levels and surrounded by landscaped gardens, this is a home that delivers\r\na wonderful sense of retreat alongside the convenience of one of Auckland's most desirable seaside suburbs.\r\n\r\nSet on approximately 614m2 (mol) of land, the residence showcases timeless weatherboard construction, generous proportions and thoughtfully designed living spaces, creating a home that effortlessly accommodates modern family life without compromising on comfort or style.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the expansive open-plan kitchen, dining and living area provides a wonderful setting for everyday living and entertaining. Large openings invite natural light inside while creating a seamless connection to the Louvretec-covered deck, allowing you to host family and friends in comfort throughout the seasons. \r\nA separate powder room on this level adds an extra touch of convenience when entertaining guests. From relaxed weekend brunches to long summer evenings, entertaining here is simply effortless.\r\n\r\nThe outdoor spaces are equally impressive. Beautifully landscaped with privacy and tranquillity in mind, the gardens create a lush, established sanctuary that feels wonderfully removed from the energy of the city. A stunning backdrop for alfresco dining, quiet morning coffees or simply unwinding in your own private oasis.\r\n\r\nAccommodation is generous and versatile, with four bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms arranged across the home's three levels. Upstairs, three bedrooms provide a peaceful retreat, including two beautifully appointed bedrooms, each enjoying the luxury of its own ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, with one serving as the master suite.\r\n\r\nOne of the home's standout features is the flexibility of its ground-floor accommodation. Offering a generous bedroom, bathroom, separate living area and convenient kitchenette, this level enjoys direct access to a private courtyard deck, along with its own external entrance and access from a separate parking area. An ideal arrangement for extended family, independent teenagers or hosting guests, it also presents exciting potential for a home and income arrangement, subject to any necessary approvals, or a dedicated work-from-home environment.\r\n\r\nCompleting the picture is double garaging and additional off-street parking, ensuring everyday practicality is just as impressive as the home's presentation.\r\nAnd then there's the location, quite simply, one of Auckland's finest. Mission Bay is celebrated for its stunning waterfront, vibrant village atmosphere and enviable lifestyle. From morning walks along the promenade and coffee at your favourite local cafe's to leisurely afternoons by the beach, this is a location where coastal living becomes part of your everyday routine.\r\n\r\nAdding to the convenience is Orakei Village, just moments away and home to a wonderful selection of eateries, boutique shops, Farro and the popular Silky Otter cinema, bringing everyday essentials and entertainment remarkably close to home. The picturesque coastline extends through neighbouring Kohimarama and St Heliers, offering beautiful beaches, swimming spots and endless opportunities to enjoy the outdoors. Auckland's CBD is just a convenient drive away, while Eastridge Shopping Centre and excellent schooling options, including Kohimarama School, Selwyn College and Baradene College, further enhance the appeal of this highly regarded address.\r\n\r\nOffering the perfect balance of privacy, quality, versatile family living and an exceptional coastal lifestyle, 45C Nihill Crescent is a home that truly deserves to be experienced.\r\n\r\nA private retreat, a prestigious address and the very best of Mission Bay living right at your fingertips.",
